    <briefdescription>
<para>Lightweight distributed-tracing context and span emitter for the base module. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Status: Wave D delivery — distributed tracing integration</para>
</simplesect>
Provides a zero-external-dependency tracing abstraction suitable for the base module runtime. The design follows OpenTelemetry concepts (trace ID, span ID, parent span ID) but is implemented with C++17 std-only primitives so that the base module retains its &quot;no external dependencies&quot; contract.</para>
<para>Key types:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>TraceContext</computeroutput> — immutable value object carrying trace/span IDs.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>SpanEmitter</computeroutput> — injectable callback interface for span events.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>ScopedSpan</computeroutput> — RAII helper that records start/end events via the injected emitter.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>NoOpSpanEmitter</computeroutput> — default no-op implementation; zero overhead when tracing is not configured.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Usage (instrumented call site): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>obtain<sp/>an<sp/>emitter<sp/>from<sp/>the<sp/>owning<sp/>subsystem<sp/>(may<sp/>be<sp/>NoOp)<sp/>—<sp/>store<sp/>by<sp/>value</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1modules_1aeaed24bd4fe681b9068c80da5239c1f3" kindref="member">SpanEmitter</ref><sp/>emitter<sp/>=<sp/>manager.spanEmitter();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">TraceContext<sp/>ctx<sp/>=<sp/>TraceContext::generate(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;hot_reload_manager.reloadModule&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ScopedSpan<sp/>span(ctx,<sp/>emitter);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>do<sp/>work<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>span<sp/>end<sp/>is<sp/>recorded<sp/>automatically<sp/>on<sp/>scope<sp/>exit</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Thread safety: <computeroutput>TraceContext</computeroutput> is a plain value type (copyable, movable). <computeroutput>ScopedSpan</computeroutput> must not be shared across threads. <computeroutput>SpanEmitter</computeroutput> implementations must be thread-safe if the emitter is shared across threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
